WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Neural Drive. Choose your route. Find your own pace.
A browser driving simulator concept by Chidera Emmanuel.

00:03.000 --> 00:10.000
A live road and a steady cockpit.
Scenery responds to simulated speed. Hands stay at rest.

00:10.000 --> 00:19.000
You choose the direction.
Buttons or keyboard shortcuts select simulated intentions.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.000
Pause whenever you need.
Time, distance and scenery stop together.

00:21.000 --> 00:26.000
Choose the view that feels right.
Cabin and driver's-eye views share the same simulation.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.000
Slow down. End your journey.
Assisted braking brings the car and scenery to a stop.

00:29.000 --> 00:33.000
Keep a private journey journal.
Virtual distance, active time and optional reflections stay in your browser.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
Also building: LocHire.
Find local workers and work nearby in Nigeria at lochire.ng.

00:38.000 --> 00:44.000
Next milestone: 5–10 accessibility sessions.
User feedback and real assistive-device validation are pending.
No brain input or real vehicle control is implemented.
